Devinism is a {{wp|List of communist ideologies|communist ideology}} developed by Australic Coscivian {{wp|wp|Post-Marxism|post-Marxist}}, {{wp|economist}}, and {{wp|Military strategy|military strategist}} Grand Admiral Varunor Devin. The ideology proposes the establishment of a {{wp|Market socialism|market socialist}} sphere of states across the world with Australis at its center. Varunor Devin proposed that {{wp|world communism}} could only ultimately be achieved through the forceful military expansion and the gaining of political influence in other countries in order to incite {{wp|world revolution}}. Devin believed communism could only succeed in {{wp|one-party states}} with {{wp|vanguardist}} communist parties dictating national doctrine in each communist state throughout the world.

